{"title":"2026 CEMC Galois Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> has vertices <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/3/193d71bcc08c2cc4079bf07eb65cb9d5cdbd7600.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A(3, 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/8/ef82b8a5ff137f3087ebf9ad0f1a04277ceaf856.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B(2, 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/d/dad99d40ed58be4047b7a101f1cc7f92d2ca4961.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C(6, 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Parts\">Parts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Parts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h